{"publicId":"2139b78d-7f76-419b-8eb7-1b911ce76659","title":"两家公司分别提交8-K文件披露金融数据监管及基本信息","status":"active","reportCount":1,"sourceCount":1,"firstReportAt":"2026-11-17T15:05:50.000Z","latestAt":"2026-11-17T15:05:50.000Z","digest":"Datacentrex, Inc.于2026年11月12日通过SEC EDGAR系统提交8-K文件，披露其涉及金融数据（FD）监管的特定事件，但未提及具体财务数据或业务变动【新】。Nexscient, Inc.于2026年11月17日提交另一份8-K文件，仅披露公司总部位于洛杉矶Century Park East及联系电话（310）494-6620，未明确说明与金融监管的直接关联【新】。SEC规定重大事件需在4个工作日内提交8-K文件，但两次提交间隔5天，且内容差异显著，显示可能为独立披露。","digestUpdatedAt":"2026-11-17T16:04:55.495Z","summary":null,"excerpt":null,"latest":"Nexscient, Inc. 发布 8-K 文件","latestReport":{"id":"hwzobalc1xvyyhygiixkux8qo"},"whyHot":{"participants48h":1,"newParticipants6h":0,"recentReports24h":1,"observationComplete":false,"rank":null},"developments":[{"factId":"fh3EV7lOqGJU","title":"Nexscient, Inc. 提交 8-K 文件","firstReportAt":"2026-11-17T15:05:50.000Z","reportCount":1,"representative":{"id":"hwzobalc1xvyyhygiixkux8qo","title":"Nexscient, Inc. 发布 8-K 文件","summary":"Nexscient, Inc. 发布 8-K 文件，披露了公司地址和联系方式。公司地址位于洛杉矶 Century Park East，电话为 (310) 494-6620。","source":{"name":"SEC EDGAR 最新申报","firstParty":true},"publishedAt":"2026-11-17T15:05:50.000Z","selected":false}}],"officialReports":[{"id":"hwzobalc1xvyyhygiixkux8qo","title":"Nexscient, Inc. 发布 8-K 文件","summary":"Nexscient, Inc. 发布 8-K 文件，披露了公司地址和联系方式。公司地址位于洛杉矶 Century Park East，电话为 (310) 494-6620。","source":{"name":"SEC EDGAR 最新申报","firstParty":true},"publishedAt":"2026-11-17T15:05:50.000Z","selected":false}],"timeline":[{"id":"hwzobalc1xvyyhygiixkux8qo","title":"Nexscient, Inc. 发布 8-K 文件","summary":"Nexscient, Inc. 发布 8-K 文件，披露了公司地址和联系方式。公司地址位于洛杉矶 Century Park East，电话为 (310) 494-6620。","source":{"name":"SEC EDGAR 最新申报","firstParty":true},"publishedAt":"2026-11-17T15:05:50.000Z","selected":false}],"heat":[{"hour":"2026-11-12T22:00:00.000Z","heat":7.7,"participants":1},{"hour":"2026-11-13T14:00:00.000Z","heat":4.9,"participants":1},{"hour":"2026-11-13T15:00:00.000Z","heat":4.7,"participants":1},{"hour":"2026-